), dealing damage as well as reducing their movement and attack speed. Zeus gets %vision_radius% unobstructed vision around him for 3 seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "hop_distance", "hop_duration", "hop_height", "range", "vision_radius", "vision_duration", "duration", "move_slow", "aspd_slow", "targets", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "zuus_cloud", "name_zh": "宙斯·雷云", "name_en": "Nimbus", "description_zh": "在地图任意地点创造一朵雷云，雷云将自动对附近敌人施放雷击。", "description_en": "Creates a storm cloud anywhere on the map that automatically casts Lightning Bolt on nearby enemies.", "notes_zh": ["敌方英雄将其摧毁后可以获得%cloud_bounty_tooltip%金。", "以宙斯当前等级的雷击作用于最近的敌方单位。", "防御塔和非英雄单位对雷云造成半额伤害。"], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["cloud_duration", "cloud_bolt_interval", "cloud_radius", "hits_to_kill_tooltip", "creep_hits_to_kill_tooltip", "cloud_bounty_tooltip", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "zuus_lightning_hands", "name_zh": "宙斯·霹雳之手", "name_en": "Lightning Hands", "description_zh": "宙斯获得攻击速度加成，并且他的攻击会产生弧形闪电，造成一定百分比的伤害。可以关闭，使攻击不附带该效果。", "description_en": "Zeus gains bonus attack speed and his attacks create Arc Lightnings that deal a percentage of its damage. Can be toggled off to stop this effect.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["attack_speed_bonus", "arc_lightning_damage_pct", "arc_lightning_damage_illusion_pct"]}, {"subject": "zuus_thundergods_wrath", "name_zh": "宙斯·雷神之怒", "name_en": "Thundergod's Wrath", "description_zh": "用闪电打击所有敌方英雄，对他们造成伤害，无论他们身在何处。在打击前提供每个英雄的真实视域。", "description_en": "Strikes all enemy heroes with a bolt of lightning, dealing damage no matter where they may be. Provides True Sight around each hero before they are struck.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["sight_radius_day", "sight_radius_night", "sight_duration", "damage", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "zuus_static_field", "name_zh": "宙斯·静电场", "name_en": "Static Field", "description_zh": "宙斯攻击或通过技能击中敌人都会电击他们，造成他们当前生命值一定百分比的伤害。", "description_en": "Zeus shocks any enemy that he attacks or is hit by his abilities, causing damage equal to a percentage of their current health.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_health_pct"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_torrent", "name_zh": "昆卡·洪流", "name_en": "Torrent", "description_zh": "召唤喷涌的洪流，短暂延迟后，将敌人冲上天，造成伤害、眩晕和减速。", "description_en": "Summons a rising torrent that, after a short delay, hurls enemy units into the sky, stunning, dealing damage and slowing movement speed.", "notes_zh": ["初始泡泡效果仅对队友可见，并且提供战争迷雾中的视野。", "飞到半空的单位将会被眩晕并且可以被攻击。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "movespeed_bonus", "slow_duration", "stun_duration", "delay", "torrent_damage", "damage_tick_interval", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_tidebringer", "name_zh": "昆卡·潮汐使者", "name_en": "Tidebringer", "description_zh": "昆卡的传奇之剑使他的下一次攻击附加额外的攻击力并在前方造成大范围的分裂攻击伤害。", "description_en": "Kunkka's legendary sword grants increased damage and cleaves a large area of effect in front of him for a single strike.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["cleave_starting_width", "cleave_ending_width", "cleave_distance", "damage_bonus", "cleave_damage", "movespeed_slow", "movespeed_slow_duration", "pierces_armor", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_x_marks_the_spot", "name_zh": "昆卡·X标记", "name_en": "X Marks the Spot", "description_zh": "对友方或敌方英雄使用，用 X 标记他们当前位置，数秒后将他们送回 X 标记处。在技能持续时间内，昆卡可以手动触发送回。对友方英雄使用后持续时间加倍。", "description_en": "Targets a friendly or enemy Hero, marks their position with an X, and returns them to it after several seconds.  Kunkka can trigger the return at any time during the duration. Lasts twice as long on allied heroes.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "allied_duration", "fow_range", "fow_duration", "rum_allies_radius", "buff_duration", "movespeed_bonus", "ghostship_absorb", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_admirals_rum", "name_zh": "昆卡·统帅朗姆酒", "name_en": "Admiral's Rum", "description_zh": "如果昆卡受到来自敌方英雄、建筑或肉山的伤害会使他的生命低于%damage_threshold%%%临界值，那么他会浸在统帅朗姆酒中，获得移动速度加成，并且延后承受即将受到的%ghostship_absorb%%%伤害，持续%buff_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Damage from enemy heroes, buildings, or Roshan that would reduce Kunkka below %damage_threshold%%% threshold causes him to douse himself with The Admiral's Rum, receiving bonus movement speed and a delayed reaction to %ghostship_absorb%%% of incoming damage for %buff_duration%s.", "notes_zh": ["在朗姆酒效果消失后造成的伤害不能致死，而且不能杀死英雄。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_threshold", "ghostship_absorb", "buff_duration", "movespeed_bonus", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_tidal_wave", "name_zh": "昆卡·潮汐波", "name_en": "Tidal Wave", "description_zh": "释放一道在昆卡身后出现的潮汐波。造成点伤害，并将敌人沿着波浪拖拽距离。敌人被拖拽时无法攻击。", "description_en": "Releases a Tidal Wave that spawns behind Kunkka. Deals damage and drags enemies along it. Enemies cannot attack while being dragged.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["speed", "radius", "damage", "duration", "wave_distance_tooltip", "knockback_distance", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_ghostship", "name_zh": "昆卡·幽灵船", "name_en": "Ghostship", "description_zh": "召唤一艘幽灵船驶过战场，直到撞成粉碎，残骸周围的敌人将会因撞击受到伤害并眩晕。被幽灵船碰到的友军会获得2倍效果的统帅朗姆酒。", "description_en": "Summons a ghostly ship that sails through the battle before smashing apart, damaging and stunning all enemies caught near the wreckage.Allied heroes touched by the Ghostship are given a %rum_factor%x strong swig of The Admiral's Rum.", "notes_zh": ["幽灵船实际的碰撞范围比船本身大。", "幽灵船的移动速度为%ghostship_speed%。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "幽灵船在目标地点以%fleet_interval%秒的间隔产生%fleet_count%艘船组成的舰队。每艘船现在还会从左舷和右舷发射%num_cannon_volleys%波炮弹，穿过敌人时造成%cannon_ball_damage_pct%%%幽灵船伤害。", "en": "Ghostship creates a fleet of %fleet_count% ships at the target point on a %fleet_interval% second interval. Each ship now also fires %num_cannon_volleys% waves of cannonballs from the port and starboard side that deal %cannon_ball_damage_pct%%% of Ghostship's damage as they pass through enemies."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["tooltip_delay", "ghostship_distance", "ghostship_width", "stun_duration", "ghostship_speed", "rum_factor", "fleet_interval", "fleet_count", "fire_cannons", "cannon_ball_damage_pct", "cannon_ball_distance", "cannon_ball_speed", "cannon_count", "cannon_ball_radius", "num_cannon_volleys"]}]
